{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/getawayadventures/items/29264/", "pk": 29264, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/getawayadventures/", "pk": 8883, "shortname": "getawayadventures", "name": "Getaway Adventures", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Healdsburg Sip 'N Cycle", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 0, "unicode": "Healdsburg Sip 'N Cycle", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 7.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_reached_hours": 7.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 2, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": true, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 0, "description": "#Come savor the wines of the Dry Creek Valley!\n\n##Rates\n • **Adult** $209 *Ages 16 and up*\n • **Child/Teen** $160 *Ages <15*\n\n##Time\n **10:00AM - 3:30PM**\n\n##About\nImagine going to Provence without leaving the country... Sun kissed vines, olive trees, and the golden hills. We cycle along the newly paved quiet back roads, to family owned wineries, one mile at a time… \n\n**Arguably the best bicycling day trip anywhere in the country.** A fantastic, quiet road where every turn brings a picture postcard view. Come cycle with us Getaway Style. No one matches our routes, bikes and most importantly our guides. Discover the beauty and tranquility of these fabled wine regions. Our award winning guides will take you to all the best places, prepare a tasty picnic spread, and take you into the vineyards for our “grapes 101”.\nWe travel 10 to 12 miles, visit 2 wineries, and have our picnic lunch at one of our favorites. Rated easy and mostly flat. Suitable for all abilities. Includes use of e-bike and helmet, all gear, van support, unlimited bottled spring water and bars. Professional guide(s), free wine pickup. Wine country picnic lunch also included.\n\n\n##Meeting Location\n• **Getaway Adventures/Wine Country Bikes, 359 Hudson St, Healdsburg, 95448**\n\n\n##Includes\n • **Use of Electric bike and helmet, unlimited water, Wine Country picnic lunch, and professional local guides.**\n\n\n##Wineries we may visit\n • **Quivira, Martorana, Mauritson, Bella, Comstock, Truett Hurst, Mill Creek, Kokomo, Dry Creek and many others**", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "Dry Creek Wine Region: Healdsburg, CA", "booking_notes": "#Meeting Location\n• **Getaway Adventures/Wine Country Bikes\n[402 Moore Ln, Healdsburg, CA 95448](https://www.google.com/maps/place/402+Moore+Ln,+Healdsburg,+CA+95448/@38.611377,-122.876938,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x80841735a476ff47:0x855c764867adb322!8m2!3d38.611377!4d-122.8743631!16s%2Fg%2F11rnfbdpw4?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTIwOS4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D)**\n\n\n#Includes\n • **Use of [Regular pedal bike or, if chosen, E-bike](http://getawayadventures.com/about/gear/) and helmet, unlimited water, lunch, and [professional local guides](http://getawayadventures.com/about/team/).**\n• **Does not include wine tasting fees ($30 to $50 per winery) or Guide Gratuity, suggested 10-20% per person.**\n\n#Wineries we may visit\n • **Quivira, Pasterick, Longboard, Martorana, Mill Creek, Comstock, Rued, Amista, Dry Creek and many others**\n\n\n#Contact\n**Please call if you have any questions**\n• **M-F: 9:00-5:30 - 1-800-499-2453\n   After Hours/Weekends - 1-707-753-0866**", "cancellation_notes": "Getaway Adventures charges the full balance at the time of booking with a $25 per person non-refundable deposit, included in the price. Any cancellations made more than 3 days prior to the tour will be refunded the balance of their tour, less the $25 per person deposit. Any cancellations made within 3 days of the tour will be charged the full tour price, but a voucher for the full price will be issued and may be used towards any future tour.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "From $209 • 5.5 Hours • A local favorite! • All ages!", "short_description": null, "image_url": "", "image_cdn_url": "", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/getawayadventures/items/29264/images/350294/", "pk": 350294, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/CtHNMZJWQ7CYQmPbaoM5", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/CtHNMZJWQ7CYQmPbaoM5", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/getawayadventures/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/getawayadventures/items/29264/"}, "crop": {"y": 96, "x": 0, "width": 2553, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6QtlqGStTi683k9VDt9O", "height": 1344}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6QtlqGStTi683k9VDt9O", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6QtlqGStTi683k9VDt9O", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/getawayadventures/items/29264/images/350295/", "pk": 350295, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/t9GJ2JCNRLSwa5xUho4b", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/t9GJ2JCNRLSwa5xUho4b", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/getawayadventures/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/getawayadventures/items/29264/"}, "crop": {"y": 42, "x": 0, "width": 2560, "url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/42LoSJswRpiOCLHj3zod", "height": 1347}, 